<description>&lt;p&gt;CAR forces, trained by Rwanda special forces, have neutralised 34 Boko Haram and ISWAP fighters in the Lake Chad area, extending their anti-terrorism operations beyond national borders. The UN Security Council renewed the MINUSCA mandate to 2027, reduced the troop ceiling to 12,000 and ordered a gradual drawdown while keeping the mission in place. Wagner Group’s gold interests continue to impede peace efforts as they expand their presence in daily life across the country. The UCDP recorded 246 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPRTdQVW45UnhQVW1KMzkyeERPQ3ZaSEd3QzFlYzBxRkZKYVEwb2tEeDNjbHgtdkY3ZVd4UlZMNkxaSmpqS0ZBamNhQ1lIMTNsTEFlc3ZpMHVfanFfeG9DVy1lLWY2TDRHRzg4WEdEMDdVd28yWm96eEFlVWVRRFQwUFoxVUZpbFFDcGgwMmJiS3g4QzdYODFpLXdJZTlsR0FNTVlsd0U1UXA?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOQkY4UERnOXV4QjFWbDhSdFNyN1J2R1BzMFVDUXhfMVh2NndIZGhCQU10eFpqT1JJTS1rdjIzdlNxVllGbWFMXzE5SlRzYjVKdUE1Z2lJbWRyRVBxa2F6andLU2ZCeFNsejFYYWZudkEzeEJ3ZWc2cEZONkpUZWkzYzhxVkMyS3NCdjRBOFNfUkYtZzhUZm5PODB1VlZleVREQmhsc3czYXJDWWdGLTFzaVhUZ3M?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Kyiv Independent&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNYkJTcElyaFl4UmoydGVzTjdQRzB1Q3FUYzU1Smx5TFE5WjN3eWxZU2dqYVk2ZlZFNDJZWWFfcTdsM2hEbkx3U0xyYWRxOVJIQWRxNURtWUg2TFJOUk00YU1hYnVXYW1zeUY1SzdLbTZFaUJaUEltVkFaMWg4aVhoT25mMWo1d2ZpVzZCNDRJa21sbUJ4czRSRWZHUkdMUjhHSWl1NlNsUUk5WFlFeVNtZHJHbmVRa3FPVWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE01M3NjbjBoQjRsa0FnZDF1RHNRVFlPYi1uV0RfSmpvTkY0S3ZURy1vZHNvR3FpR0hsWUJNeURpRTgtUkRpcEVIYWRXNVYwemVKYXZnVy1oZUo1MmdoejN2N25HU3NBSmlfN0lnX0wzbVB4ZkFPQTBIQ25ZbTU?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quo